Date: Thu, 1 Oct 2026 07:20:48 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 1/2] Reserve HQ calls from a server USD-cent quote before the
 socket opens.

Routing weights stay on the ladder. A missing quote or ceiling sends nothing.
One caller owns the emit right, and an unknown emission is not released by time.
